{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27250","headline":"织绫词 · 章孝标","name":"织绫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年蚕恶绫帛贵，官急无丝织红泪。\n残经脆纬不通梭，鹊凤阑珊失头尾。\n今年蚕好缲白丝，鸟鲜花活人不知。\n瑶台雪里鹤张翅，禁苑风前梅折枝。\n不学隣家妇慵懒，蜡揩粉拭谩官眼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}